WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.270
There’s something called the 80/20 rule.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.300
It states that 80% of the results
come from 20% of the action.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.200
Everything that matters
is the accuracy of your moves.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.500
I used to tell people a specific number
of puzzles they should solve in 20 minutes,

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.650
but they often ended up rushing the puzzles.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.050
Focus on accuracy.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.200
It doesn’t matter how many puzzles
you can solve in 20 minutes.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.450
To build a habit, make it very simple
and very achievable.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:26.080
For 20 minutes, you only solve puzzles.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.420
The world can wait.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.340
Just exist and play chess.
